<a href="#S4.SS5.p2.1" title="4.5 𝜇P for Shampoo ‣ 4 Deriving 𝜇P using Spectral Scaling Conditions ‣ Extending 𝜇P: Spectral Conditions for Feature Learning Across Optimizers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§4.5</span></a>.
